{{- /*
api_key_made.gohtml shows a key's token once (ADR 0351).

The auth module stores only the token's hash, so this answer is the token's
only copy: it is not stored by the browser, and a token lost is not brought
back; the key is revoked and another made.
*/ -}}
{{ define "body" }}
<h1>{{ .Title }}</h1>
<p role="status">The key {{ .ID }} was made. Copy its token now; it is not shown again.</p>
<p><code>{{ .Token }}</code></p>
<p><a href="{{ .Path }}">Every key</a></p>
{{ end }}
